 chosen yet &mdash; <code>/onboard</code> asks which.</p></article></div><div class=\"panel card\"><span class=\"small muted\">1 routine\n    on your account, recorded 5 hr ago (7 Oct, 05:30). This is a snapshot, not a live reading.</span></div><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Getting set up</p><h2>Setup &middot; 2 of 3 rungs</h2></div><div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"ladder\"><div class=\"rung pass\" title=\"d\"><div class=\"bar\"></div>Brief</div><div class=\"rung pass\" title=\"d\"><div class=\"bar\"></div>Access</div><div class=\"rung \" title=\"d\"><div class=\"bar\"></div>Training</div></div></div><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">One tap</p><h2 id=\"run-jobs\">Run a job</h2></div><div class=\"fires\"><button class=\"fire job\" type=\"button\" data-fire=\"morning-brief\" data-action=\"run\"><span class=\"play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 5.5l11 6.5-11 6.5z\"/></svg></span>Morning brief</button></div>\n    <p class=\"small muted\">Starts that job now rather than waiting for its schedule. It spends one run\n    from your Claude account and leaves its work in your repo as a draft &mdash; nothing is sent\n    anywhere and nothing is deleted.</p><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">What everyone is on</p><h2>Board</h2></div><div class=\"board\">\n    <div class=\"panel col\">\n    <div class=\"col-title\"><span>To do</span><span>2</span></div>\n    <div class=\"add-task\">\n    <div class=\"add-open\">\n      <button class=\"fire\" type=\"button\" id=\"task-open\">+ Add task</button>\n      <button class=\"fire\" type=\"button\" id=\"wf-open\">+ New workflow</button>\n    </div>\n    <form id=\"task-form\" class=\"fire-form\" hidden>\n      <label for=\"task-text\">What do you want done?</label>\n      <textarea id=\"task-text\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"2200\"\n        placeholder=\"e.g. Research podcast sponsors - or - Build me a skill that drafts YouTube descriptions\"></textarea>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <select id=\"task-for\" aria-label=\"Who should do it\">\n          <option value=\"\">Anyone — let the team route it</option>\n          <option value=\"research\">research</option><option value=\"content\">content</option><option value=\"bookkeeper\">bookkeeper</option><option value=\"security\">security</option>\n        </select>\n        <button class=\"fire\" type=\"submit\" id=\"task-send\">Add</button>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"fire-note\" id=\"task-note\"></span>\n    </form>\n    <form id=\"wf-form\" class=\"fire-form\" hidden>\n      <label for=\"wf-text\">What job should run on its own?</label>\n      <textarea id=\"wf-text\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"2200\"\n        placeholder=\"e.g. Every Monday at 7, gather what changed last week and write it up for me\"></textarea>\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Say what it does and when. Your team writes the workflow and\n        asks you anything it still needs.</span>\n      <button class=\"fire\" type=\"submit\" id=\"wf-send\">Request it</button>\n      <span class=\"fire-note\" id=\"wf-note\"></span>\n    </form>\n  </div><div class=\"kcard agent-accent\" data-card=\"chase-acme\" style=\"border-left-color:#fb7185\">\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <b>Chase Acme</b>\n        \n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <span class=\"chip owner\" style=\"--agent:#fb7185\">owner: research</span>\n        <span class=\"row\">\n          <button class=\"fire small-fire\" type=\"button\" data-move=\"chase-acme\" data-status=\"doing\">Start</button>\n          <button class=\"fire small-fire\" type=\"button\" data-move=\"chase-acme\" data-status=\"done\">Done</button>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"move-note small\" hidden></div>\n    </div><div class=\"kcard agent-accent\" data-card=\"books\" style=\"border-left-color:#2dd4bf\">\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <b>Close the month</b>\n        <span class=\"chip on\">doing</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <span class=\"chip owner\" style=\"--agent:#2dd4bf\">owner: bookkeeper</span>\n        <span class=\"row\">\n          \n          <button class=\"fire small-fire\" type=\"button\" data-move=\"books\" data-status=\"done\">Done</button>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"move-note small\" hidden></div>\n    </div></div>\n    <div class=\"panel col\">\n    <div class=\"col-title\"><span>Up Next</span><span>1</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kcard agent-accent\" style=\"border-left-color:#fb7185\">\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <b>Morning brief</b>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">in 2 hr</span>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"chip owner\" style=\"--agent:#fb7185\">owner: research</span>\n    </div></div>\n    <div class=\"panel col\">\n    <div class=\"col-title\"><span>Running</span><span>1</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kcard agent-accent\" style=\"border-left-color:#fb7185\">\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <b>Inbox sweep</b>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">started 12 min ago</span>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"small watch\" href=\"https://claude.ai/code/session_2\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">watch</a>\n    </div></div>\n    <div class=\"panel col\">\n    <div class=\"col-title\"><span>Done</span><span>1</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kcard agent-accent\" style=\"border-left-color:#fb7185\">\n      <div class=\"row between\">\n        <span><span class=\"st st-ok\">&#10003;</span> <b>Morning brief</b></span>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">2 hr ago</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"summary\">Five things worth reading</p>\n    </div></div>\n  </div><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Next 24 hours</p><h2>Due next</h2></div><div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"gap row between\"><span><b>Morning brief</b> <span class=\"small muted\">daily 06:30</span></span><span class=\"small\">in 2 hr</span></div></div><div class=\"section-head